    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1><div class="legal-meta">Last updated: January 2026 &mdash; DRAFT</div>
    <div class="ce-alert ce-alert-danger"><strong>DRAFT DOCUMENT:</strong> Template for university prototype. Not reviewed for legal compliance.</div>
    <h2>1. Data Collection</h2><p>This prototype collects minimal test data: name, email, and simulated profile information. No real identity documents are collected.</p>
    <h2>2. Data Storage</h2><p>All data is stored locally in a development database (MySQL/MariaDB via XAMPP). No cloud services or third-party data processors are involved.</p>
    <h2>3. Data Protection</h2><p>Passwords are hashed using PHP's bcrypt algorithm. Sessions use secure cookie settings. CSRF protection is implemented on all forms.</p>
    <h2>4. No Real Data</h2><p>This is a test environment. Do not enter real personal information, real financial details, or real identity documents.</p>
</div></div></section>
